{"id": "EUVD-2026-96707", "enisaUuid": "d4008873-a87f-3b9f-8c5e-a700af8541e7", "description": "1Panel-dev CordysCRM before 1.9.2 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the ContractController sortModule handler for POST /contract/sort, which lacks any permission annotation. Authenticated users without contract update permission can supply a dragNodeId, stage and field values to modify any contract, including contracts in other organizations.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T01:12:27", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T19:56:27", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/CordysCRM/poc_contract_sort_write_bfla.py", "https://github.com/1Panel-dev/CordysCRM/blob/a0ef69d31fd98c338199579353840f34ef679197/backend/crm/src/main/java/cn/cordys/crm/contract/controller/ContractController.java#L279-L283", "https://github.com/1Panel-dev/CordysCRM/commit/98e2615569b402063bc02f369274a05f40217d6e", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/1panel-dev-cordyscrm-before-1.9.2-missing-authorization-via-post-contract-sort"], "aliases": ["GHSA-p6fp-39mj-m4hm", "CVE-2026-108701"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c38e6d75-eede-3090-a0d2-e5cfe036d35d", "product": {"name": "CordysCRM", "vendor": {"name": "1Panel-dev"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.9.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "45f606a1-a815-3ef6-b69b-3399db3f903e", "vendor": {"name": "1Panel-dev"}}], "isExploited": false}